# ==============================================================================
# EventWise AI Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# OPTIONAL: Google Gemini API Key for enhanced GenAI recommendations.
# If omitted or left blank, EventWise AI automatically runs using its built-in,
# high-fidelity deterministic rule engine with zero degradation in functionality.
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# - Never commit real API keys to GitHub or version control.
# - Keep .env listed in .gitignore.
# - Users can also enter a temporary session API key directly in the app UI,
#   which is kept strictly in-memory and never written to localStorage.
# ==============================================================================
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
